### ⚠️ Critical Notes & Caveats

1.  **Greedy Purity Warning (Block 10 & 13):**
    *   **Block 10:** Changes1.46.443.452 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =   1472, tg =  24.56 t/s, tg_3s =  28.76 t/s
